(7537740, 1206262, 28742, '<td valign="top">This is the epitome of Dada, I think. You nailed it for me anyway. On the other hand, you delivered what I expected, so that kind of goes against the philosophy of the movement. What to do... I''ll flip a coin from the top of a high rise building and if it bounces once on the sidewalk and subsequently hits a pedestrian in the eye, I''ll run down the stairs and get their name and if it starts with a G, I''ll give you a 10. Any other outcome (including my lack of follow through), will earn you a consolation 10. And if I don''t see this on the front page, I will climb the tallest building with a large bag of change and go on a coin tossing rampage.</td>', 'This is the epitome of Dada, I think. You nailed it for me anyway. On the other hand, you delivered what I expected, so that kind of goes against the philosophy of the movement. What to do... I''ll flip a coin from the top of a high rise building and if it bounces once on the sidewalk and subsequently hits a pedestrian in the eye, I''ll run down the stairs and get their name and if it starts with a G, I''ll give you a 10. Any other outcome (including my lack of follow through), will earn you a consolation 10. And if I don''t see this on the front page, I will climb the tallest building with a large bag of change and go on a coin tossing rampage.', '2017-10-04 02:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
