(7538637, 1205694, 30982, '<td valign="top">You crack me up.  I stop by here every now and then to see what''s on the front page, read the comments on entries, that sort of thing.  You and Wendy often have nice little novellas.  I enjoy that.  But here''s the thing - you do know you don''t have to enter every challenge, right?  If you hate the subject matter, and you feel compelled to enter anyway, do something you like at least!  With the exception of the leagues, where I''d enter what my teammates wanted, I enter what I like.  Granted, usually no one else likes it, but at least I do!  :). PS, this is hard to do on a phone.  It''s a holiday for the government but not the support contractors, and DPC is not available on work computers.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2017-10-09 11:31:06.</i></td>', 'You crack me up.  I stop by here every now and then to see what''s on the front page, read the comments on entries, that sort of thing.  You and Wendy often have nice little novellas.  I enjoy that.  But here''s the thing - you do know you don''t have to enter every challenge, right?  If you hate the subject matter, and you feel compelled to enter anyway, do something you like at least!  With the exception of the leagues, where I''d enter what my teammates wanted, I enter what I like.  Granted, usually no one else likes it, but at least I do!  :). PS, this is hard to do on a phone.  It''s a holiday for the government but not the support contractors, and DPC is not available on work computers.', '2017-10-09 12:08:55.000000', '2017-10-09 12:31:06.000000', 0),
